      "content": "Details of Kshethram:\nMoolavar: Valvil Ramar\nThayaar: Hemambujavalli Thayaar\nVimanam: Sobhana Vimanam\nPushkarani: Jatayu Theertham\nPrathyaksham: Tirumangai Azhwar\nTravel: 5 km from Kumbakonam\n\nAzhwar Pasuram: \nTirumangai Azhwar- 10",
